  (text "Slot ID (pin 11): 10k to 3.3 V here, the slot's own resistor to GND on the main board, read on GPIO4 (ADC1).\nAUX GND (28-30) is NOT joined to GND on this card (the LTE card's rule): on the main board the two meet only at NT1. The buck, its 470 uF\nand the compute module's return are on AUX_GND, the ESP32 / CAN / rail side on GND, and only logic crosses, through 1k resistors." (at 75 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0ce55d5d-a91c-5541-8d7b-2bee8f9e83ae"))
