  (text "ESP32-S3: UART1 to the compute module TX GPIO41, RX GPIO42 (through 1k). Power: BUCK_ON GPIO11 (enable of the module's buck), SHUT GPIO12 (SHUTDOWN_REQ), ALIVE GPIO13, ATTN GPIO14.\nI2S rail (slave): BCK GPIO6, WS GPIO7, MIC data GPIO15 in; RET data GPIO16 out through the 74LVC125 (enable GPIO17, low = drive).\nCAN (TWAI) TX GPIO9, RX GPIO10. Slot ID GPIO4 (ADC1), AUX 12 V present GPIO5 (ADC1), thermistor GPIO8 (ADC1). LEDs GPIO1 (module), GPIO2 (microphone open).\nNative USB GPIO19 / 20 (USB-C), debug serial TXD0 / RXD0. Not used: straps GPIO3 / 45 / 46, flash and PSRAM GPIO26-37." (at 190 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c0d51b75-d353-55ec-b4ee-5168c2b5c945"))
  (text "PROGRAMMING: USB-C (native USB, GPIO19 / 20: USB-serial-JTAG, no driver chip) with BOOT and RESET, and a debug serial header.\nThe card is powered from the slot while flashing: USB VBUS only feeds the ESD clamp." (at 15 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8caa1fe8-f6fb-5dcd-9d40-047020f082c9"))
