  (text "I2S RAIL (slot pins 15-18; the audio card is the clock master). BCK / WS / MIC are inputs to the ESP32-S3 through 100 R. RET is a 3-state\noutput: the 74LVC125's enable (GPIO17) is pulled high, so the card never drives RET until the firmware holds the grant. 33 R at the pin." (at 15 410 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ea8db9a7-74f2-53cb-9156-6ec040c62a80"))
