  (text "MODULE 5 V: TPS54560B from AUX 12 V (slot pins 25-27), the main board's 5 V circuit (TI datasheet typical application,\n400 kHz, 5.0 V) with a smaller inductor (6.8 uH, 7 x 7 mm). Load: the compute module, 1-1.5 A typical, 3 A peak.\nENABLE: the EN divider (442k / 90.9k, starts above about 6.5 V, 5.1 V zener) is fed from AUX 12 V through a P-FET (Q1) that the ESP32 switches\nwith GPIO11 through Q2. AUX_SENSE reads the buck's input (220k / 47k), never its output. Fail-safe: with the ESP32 off, in reset or unpowered the FET is off and the buck is disabled." (at 300 225 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ecd7611a-7567-508d-b108-f10b3f20d02e"))
